          f"* **invoice_number vs other IDs** (phone/GSTIN/date): {cnt('invoice_number', 'other ID')}; invoice_number not locatable {cnt('invoice_number', 'locatable')}, wrong value {cnt('invoice_number', 'wrong value (incorrect')}, false positives {cnt('invoice_number', 'false positive')} (many ReceiptBench bills simply have no annotated invoice number).",
